 "remarks": "Month- to- month winter season.  Months available: October through April. The Fall months and Holiday season are magical in Rowayton! Make the Frederic E. Lockwood House (circa 1897) your home for the Fall/ winter. This designer renovated Victorian has 2 wood-burning fireplaces and amenities galore - a modern eat-in kitchen/ family room with fireplace, marble counters, and Viking range.  Right off the deck is a gas grill in the fenced-in yard, featuring a majestic stag sculpture. Completing the main level, you'll be delighted by the office, dining room, and living room. Upstairs, there is the luxurious primary suite with fireplace, ensuite bath with double sinks, and walk-in closet. Also on this level, are two additional bedrooms plus a hall bath with laundry. On the third floor/ attic level, there is a sweet bedroom with lounge area. Minutes away from downtown Rowayton and Metro North. Convenient to Pinkney Park and Bayley Beach Park for strolling along the shoreline. This season, enjoy being cozy in a fabulous country house that is close to NYC via Metro North. Dogs welcome - inquire about restrictions.",
